From c683b1265312826abbfbc296f7f892c4e6fd2ec3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ranjith Katravula <RanjithKumar.Katravula@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Mar 2026 10:37:34 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] visp: visp_video: Add stride-aware format handling

- Extend cam_device output format metadata with:
  - buf_offset (YUV/RAW offsets)
  - buf_stride (Y/RAW stride)
- Populate IspFmt->buf_stride for YUV and RAW media pixel formats in
  media_fmt_to_isp_fmt(), including packed/aligned RAW variants.
- Update visp_video_mfmt_to_vfmt() to compute bytesperline with explicit
  alignment handling for packed YUV/RGB formats and private VISP formats.
- Align bytesperline and sizeimage consistently for single-plane and
  multi-plane formats.

This improves consistency between ISP format mapping and V4L2 buffer layout
expectations when stride alignment is required.

Signed-off-by: Ranjith Katravula <RanjithKumar.Katravula@amd.com>
---
 common/visp_align.h                           | 77 +++++++++++++++++++
 visp/visp_app.c                               | 53 +++++++++++++
 visp/visp_procfs.c                            | 36 ++++++++-
 .../include/cam_device/cam_device_api.h       |  2 +
 .../include/cam_device/cam_device_common.h    | 24 ++++++
 visp_video/visp_video_register.c              | 40 ++++++++--
 6 files changed, 225 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 common/visp_align.h
 mode change 100644 => 100755 visp/visp_app.c
 mode change 100644 => 100755 visp/vsi_units/include/cam_device/cam_device_api.h
 mode change 100644 => 100755 visp/vsi_units/include/cam_device/cam_device_common.h

